WEBVTT

00:04.337 --> 00:07.007
Ichii, you've got mail or something?

00:07.007 --> 00:09.009
Yeah. I wonder whom it's from.

00:09.009 --> 00:10.010
Let's see...

00:10.010 --> 00:11.678
It's from Sarasa!

00:11.678 --> 00:13.346
Wow! What did she say?

00:13.346 --> 00:15.682
Sarasa...

00:15.682 --> 00:17.684
She called him that time, too.

00:17.684 --> 00:19.345
She is Ichii's...

00:20.353 --> 00:23.023
It says, "I hope you've
been doing well with Zero."

00:23.023 --> 00:24.691
Sure! We've been doing very well!

00:24.691 --> 00:27.694
But it's pointless to say
that to a cell phone zura.

00:27.694 --> 00:29.029
Shut up!

00:29.029 --> 00:32.032
Anyway, it's Sarasa!
It brings back memories.

00:32.032 --> 00:33.700
It's been three years since then!

00:33.700 --> 00:36.036
I guess it was around the same time
when I first met you, huh, Zero?

00:36.036 --> 00:38.204
Hey, who is Sarasa-san anyway?

00:38.204 --> 00:40.365
When did Ichii and Zero first meet?

00:42.042 --> 00:46.379
Sarasa is the person I used to like.

00:46.379 --> 00:49.212
That's not something we
should hide from her, right?

00:50.717 --> 00:54.888
It's a long story, but would you
care to listen? About Sarasa and me.

00:54.888 --> 00:56.389
About the sorcery test.

00:56.389 --> 01:00.553
And about the time when we first met...

01:01.094 --> 01:13.706
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.706 --> 01:19.979
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.979 --> 01:26.219
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.219 --> 01:32.525
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.525 --> 01:38.798
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.798 --> 01:45.071
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.071 --> 01:51.344
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.344 --> 01:57.650
They say there is only one true love

01:57.650 --> 02:03.957
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.957 --> 02:10.196
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.196 --> 02:16.503
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.503 --> 02:22.775
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.775 --> 02:27.542
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:40.827 --> 02:44.330
You son of a bitch! I told you to wait!

02:44.330 --> 02:47.500
You just bumped into someone,
but you can't even say "Excuse me"?

02:47.500 --> 02:49.502
My shoulder bones are broken now.

02:49.502 --> 02:51.337
You'd better give me some money
for medical bills.

02:51.337 --> 02:55.508
Humph, is this a so-called standard tactic
to screw money out of someone, huh?

02:55.508 --> 02:57.844
Try to stretch your wits
a little more, you moron!

02:57.844 --> 02:59.179
What did you just say, punk?

02:59.179 --> 03:01.841
You'd better watch your mouth,
you little shit!

03:04.851 --> 03:05.840
You son of a bitch!

03:18.865 --> 03:21.201
Humph! Nothing but talk, eh?

03:21.201 --> 03:22.202
Shit!

03:22.202 --> 03:24.534
You frickin' brat!

03:29.209 --> 03:31.211
He-He bounced me off!

03:31.211 --> 03:36.376
I'm sorry, but no attack
will work on me. Humph

03:37.884 --> 03:39.215
You're pretty cool!

03:46.392 --> 03:48.394
Hey, do you want
to have a match with me?

03:48.394 --> 03:49.395
A match?

03:49.395 --> 03:50.396
Yeah!

03:50.396 --> 03:55.231
I'm looking for someone strong.
So right now I want you to-

04:00.406 --> 04:02.108
Okay, I won.

04:02.108 --> 04:04.235
Now get out of here, you knucklehead.

04:06.246 --> 04:08.581
I've found an awesome one!

04:08.581 --> 04:11.584
He beat me and he's cool!

04:11.584 --> 04:15.922
All right, I've decided it!
I'm going to pick him! He is my...

04:15.922 --> 04:17.583
Partner!

04:22.095 --> 04:23.426
Hey, that's-

04:24.931 --> 04:27.100
That jerk was over here again?

04:27.100 --> 04:29.269
Hey, what the hell are you doing? Hey!

04:29.269 --> 04:30.436
Oh, Ichii!

04:30.436 --> 04:33.273
- Get away from Sarasa!
- Jeff!

04:33.273 --> 04:35.942
Don't you ever come near her!
Now get the hell out of here!

04:35.942 --> 04:37.273
Ichii!

04:38.945 --> 04:40.276
Ichii!

04:41.614 --> 04:42.949
What are you doing, Ichii?

04:42.949 --> 04:45.918
Sarasa, I told you not
to see him, didn't I?

04:45.918 --> 04:48.621
You already know that
he's not serious about you, right?

04:48.621 --> 04:51.457
That's not true! Listen to me, Ichii!

04:51.457 --> 04:53.293
I've promised him...

04:53.293 --> 04:55.795
I will marry Jeff!

04:55.795 --> 04:57.630
You've got to be kidding me!

04:57.630 --> 05:00.967
What makes you think rich people
would take us seriously?

05:00.967 --> 05:02.969
He's been fooling you, Sarasa!

05:02.969 --> 05:06.632
That's not true! Jeff isn't
that kind of person! He's not-

05:07.807 --> 05:08.975
Ichii!

05:08.975 --> 05:11.311
I've been asking you not
to act this way, haven't I?

05:11.311 --> 05:13.313
We are siblings!

05:13.313 --> 05:16.316
We may be siblings,
but we're not biologically related!

05:16.316 --> 05:20.486
The only person I can trust is you!
You're the only one, Sarasa!

05:20.486 --> 05:24.324
I love you... Let me be your No. 1!

05:24.324 --> 05:28.661
You're the No. 1, because you are
my precious younger brother, Ichii...

05:28.661 --> 05:30.330
Not as your younger brother!

05:30.330 --> 05:33.666
We're going to have an
engagement party at his home soon,

05:33.666 --> 05:36.502
and I want you to be there, too, Ichii.

05:36.502 --> 05:37.670
What the hell is that?

05:37.670 --> 05:40.340
No way! I will never go!

05:40.340 --> 05:43.332
Who would go to your stupid
engagement party anyway?

05:46.679 --> 05:48.681
Don't cry, Sarasa...

05:48.681 --> 05:49.682
But...

05:49.682 --> 05:53.753
Damn it! All right, I'll go! Fine!

05:53.753 --> 05:57.857
I shouldn't make you sad,
should I, Sarasa? I'll be there...

05:57.857 --> 05:59.692
Really?

05:59.692 --> 06:01.361
Thank you, Ichii!

06:01.361 --> 06:05.031
But that doesn't mean I have approved
of the marriage part, all right?

06:05.031 --> 06:08.368
Okay, thank you! Thank you!

06:08.368 --> 06:12.705
How am I supposed to feel
when I see you this happy?

06:12.705 --> 06:16.607
Just how am I supposed to feel...

06:19.379 --> 06:21.447
Ladies and gentlemen!

06:21.447 --> 06:26.319
I just wanted to thank you all very much
for taking time in your busy schedule

06:26.319 --> 06:28.388
to attend this engagement party
for Sarasa and I today.

06:28.388 --> 06:29.389
Congratulations!

06:29.389 --> 06:31.323
He's got a beautiful fiancée!

06:34.394 --> 06:37.295
- This is so nice!
- I envy them!

06:40.566 --> 06:43.403
I was right. I should've never come here...

06:43.403 --> 06:45.171
I feel like I came all the way out here

06:45.171 --> 06:47.507
to be reminded how much
they're in love with each other...

06:47.507 --> 06:49.742
This only confirmed that
there's nothing I can do about it

06:49.742 --> 06:52.412
and this issue is completely
out of my control...

06:52.412 --> 06:59.750
So after all, am I just a younger brother
to Sarasa? Is that all I am to her?

07:07.593 --> 07:10.430
This is great! I didn't think
I'd run into you at a place like this!

07:10.430 --> 07:12.098
This must be fate!

07:12.098 --> 07:13.087
Huh?

07:15.101 --> 07:17.770
Hey, you're the one from the other day!

07:17.770 --> 07:21.107
You know, that moment I just
told myself, "This is the guy!"

07:21.107 --> 07:22.108
Hey, you!

07:22.108 --> 07:23.109
What do you want?

07:23.109 --> 07:26.112
Do you want to be my partner?

07:26.112 --> 07:27.947
What?

07:27.947 --> 07:29.676
Partner?

07:31.617 --> 07:33.453
Partner!

07:33.453 --> 07:35.455
Ichii! Ichii!

07:35.455 --> 07:37.957
Oh, hi, Sarasa!

07:37.957 --> 07:40.793
Huh? Why do you know Sarasa?

07:40.793 --> 07:44.464
What are you talking about Ichii?
He's Jeff's younger brother.

07:44.464 --> 07:46.466
What? Jeff's?

07:46.466 --> 07:47.800
So he must be-

07:47.800 --> 07:50.136
Ichii. He's my younger brother.

07:50.136 --> 07:53.306
Ichii? Ichii, huh?

07:53.306 --> 07:55.975
It's a little unusual name,
but it's a good name!

07:55.975 --> 07:57.810
Ichii, huh?

07:57.810 --> 08:00.313
I had no idea that you two were friends.

08:00.313 --> 08:04.484
Wait here. I'll bring something
that you can dry yourself with.

08:04.484 --> 08:06.486
Thank you!

08:06.486 --> 08:09.822
H-Hey, Ichii! Ichii! Hey!

08:09.822 --> 08:10.890
I don't want to!

08:10.890 --> 08:12.558
I haven't said anything yet!

08:12.558 --> 08:13.493
I don't want to!

08:13.493 --> 08:15.661
I want to be a professional sorcerer!

08:15.661 --> 08:17.497
Isn't that cool?
But in order to become one

08:17.497 --> 08:21.167
I have to pick a partner
and pass the sorcery test.

08:21.167 --> 08:23.669
Hey, you do know about
the sorcery test, right, Ichii?

08:23.669 --> 08:24.837
Yeah.

08:24.837 --> 08:28.174
That's the test where two
people pair up to take it right?

08:28.174 --> 08:31.511
That's the super difficult license
that only one team gets per year.

08:31.511 --> 08:35.181
Exactly! And I've been looking for
a partner that could take the test with me!

08:35.181 --> 08:37.683
You know, someone strong and cool!

08:37.683 --> 08:40.353
Ichii, I want that to be you!

08:40.353 --> 08:43.686
I want to make you my partner!

08:45.024 --> 08:46.859
What is it that I'm feeling?

08:46.859 --> 08:49.529
This guy and I become partners?

08:49.529 --> 08:51.864
I've been a loner for a long time.

08:51.864 --> 08:54.196
And I was going to stay
that way in the future...

08:56.202 --> 09:00.696
But for some reason
my frozen heart heatedly...

09:02.542 --> 09:04.203
Aches...

09:05.545 --> 09:09.415
Come on! Let's take
the sorcery test together!

09:09.415 --> 09:12.051
Let's go chase our dreams together!

09:12.051 --> 09:15.054
Know the difference between the dream
and the reality at least, you knucklehead!

09:15.054 --> 09:17.290
Then what is your dream Ichii?

09:17.290 --> 09:19.656
What is your dream
that you want to protect?

09:22.562 --> 09:26.555
My dream... My dream
that I want to protect is...

09:27.900 --> 09:29.902
Ichii.

09:29.902 --> 09:35.575
I want to be by Sarasa...
That's all I want...

09:35.575 --> 09:38.578
But my dream is no longer...

09:38.578 --> 09:39.579
Hey!

09:39.579 --> 09:41.247
It's cool, right, Ichii?

09:41.247 --> 09:43.583
Let's take the sorcery test together!

09:43.583 --> 09:48.921
If you want to join the cram school,
I'll talk to Jeff for you, so come on!

09:48.921 --> 09:51.123
Oh, that's right, he is...

09:51.123 --> 09:53.926
I get it... If that's the case...

09:53.926 --> 09:57.263
If you insist, I'd consider
becoming your partner.

09:57.263 --> 09:59.098
What? Really?

09:59.098 --> 09:59.599
Sure!

09:59.599 --> 10:00.099
I'll use him...
Sure!

10:00.099 --> 10:01.267
I'll use him...
But in return...

10:01.267 --> 10:02.268
I'll use him...
I need some money right now.

10:02.268 --> 10:04.604
I'll use him.
I need some money right now.

10:04.604 --> 10:07.106
So you'd help me
if I were in trouble, right?

10:07.106 --> 10:08.107
This little boy's family is rich.
So you'd help me
if I were in trouble, right?

10:08.107 --> 10:09.609
This little boy's family is rich.
I'd appreciate it if you could
arrange something by tomorrow.

10:09.609 --> 10:09.942
I'll use him...
I'd appreciate it if you could
arrange something by tomorrow.

10:09.942 --> 10:10.943
I'll use him...
It's 30,000 shells.

10:10.943 --> 10:12.278
That much wouldn't hurt it, right?
It's 30,000 shells.

10:12.278 --> 10:12.945
That much wouldn't hurt it, right?
Huh? Ichii...

10:12.945 --> 10:14.947
Huh? Ichii...

10:14.947 --> 10:17.617
So if I bring it to you,
would you be my partner?

10:17.617 --> 10:21.781
Sure, if you bring it.
I'm counting on you.

10:23.289 --> 10:24.624
Okay.

10:24.624 --> 10:29.118
His family must be struggling...
30,000 shells, huh...

10:34.800 --> 10:37.303
He sure is late.

10:37.303 --> 10:40.139
After all that talk,
he'd better not have flaked on me.

10:40.139 --> 10:42.308
Hey! Ichii!

10:42.308 --> 10:43.643
Ichii!

10:43.643 --> 10:44.644
You're late!

10:44.644 --> 10:47.813
I'm sorry. I couldn't find a place
where I could sell my skateboard.

10:47.813 --> 10:49.148
Skateboard?

10:49.148 --> 10:50.650
Here. It's 30,000 shells!

10:50.650 --> 10:55.655
What? You've sold your skateboard?
Why? Your family is rich, right?

10:55.655 --> 10:58.991
My family wouldn't give me
more allowance than I need.

10:58.991 --> 11:04.997
That skateboard was my treasure,
but it's okay! It's for Ichii anyway!

11:04.997 --> 11:06.666
Here!

11:06.666 --> 11:07.667
Thanks.

11:07.667 --> 11:10.336
Now you and I are partners, right?

11:10.336 --> 11:13.506
Hey, let's practice magic
to prepare for the sorcery test!

11:13.506 --> 11:14.840
When do you want to come to my house?

11:14.840 --> 11:15.741
How about today?

11:15.741 --> 11:16.676
I'm busy.

11:16.676 --> 11:18.511
Then how about tomorrow?

11:18.511 --> 11:19.679
How about the day after tomorrow?

11:19.679 --> 11:23.182
Shut up! Stop following me around!

11:23.182 --> 11:25.685
Then let's do it at 10 AM tomorrow!

11:25.685 --> 11:28.354
I'll be waiting for you
right here at 10 AM tomorrow!

11:28.354 --> 11:32.358
Ichii, that's a promise!
You'd better come!

11:32.358 --> 11:34.349
You'd better come for sure!

11:39.198 --> 11:41.300
Today's weather is heavy rain.

11:41.300 --> 11:43.703
And it's going to be even
more severe in the afternoon,

11:43.703 --> 11:45.705
so you might want to stay in
as much as possible.

11:45.705 --> 11:48.374
It's raining so hard.

11:48.374 --> 11:53.573
I'll be waiting for you right here
at 10 AM tomorrow! That's a promise!

11:55.381 --> 11:57.042
I'm not going...

12:02.722 --> 12:05.850
Who would go? Knucklehead!

12:23.743 --> 12:26.412
I couldn't trust anything.

12:26.412 --> 12:28.080
And I didn't have anything.

12:28.080 --> 12:33.419
But to be honest, I was flustered
by this little boy,

12:33.419 --> 12:36.088
who'd come straight into my heart.

12:36.088 --> 12:39.759
I tried not to let it get to me,
but I still couldn't help it.

12:39.759 --> 12:43.429
Do you want to be my partner?

12:43.429 --> 12:44.764
Partner!

12:44.764 --> 12:47.933
I'll be waiting for you right here
at 10 AM tomorrow!

12:47.933 --> 12:49.101
Damn it!

12:49.101 --> 12:50.102
I'm going out for a bit!

12:50.102 --> 12:52.263
What? You mean, in this rain?

12:54.774 --> 12:55.775
That's right.

12:55.775 --> 12:58.110
I'm irritated because
I don't know for sure.

12:58.110 --> 13:01.447
Once I confirm he's not there,
I'm sure I won't feel this way.

13:01.447 --> 13:02.778
I'm sure...

13:06.619 --> 13:07.950
He's not here.

13:14.960 --> 13:17.797
After all there's no way
I could trust anyone...

13:17.797 --> 13:20.129
Anyone other than Sarasa...

13:23.803 --> 13:25.464
Ichii...

13:26.806 --> 13:28.467
Ichii...

13:29.809 --> 13:31.143
Z-Zero!

13:31.143 --> 13:32.132
Zero!

13:32.812 --> 13:35.481
Hey! Hang in there!

13:35.481 --> 13:40.986
Ichii... I knew you would come.

13:40.986 --> 13:43.155
I'm glad.

13:43.155 --> 13:44.816
Zero! Zero!

13:45.825 --> 13:47.656
He feels so hot!

13:50.830 --> 13:52.164
So Zero is...

13:52.164 --> 13:53.833
I'm sure it's just a simple cold.

13:53.833 --> 13:56.324
He'll be just fine if he
sleeps through the night.

13:57.336 --> 13:58.504
Ichii-kun...

13:58.504 --> 14:04.510
Sarasa told me that you wouldn't
trust anyone else but her.

14:04.510 --> 14:08.514
Sarasa is very worried about you.

14:08.514 --> 14:12.184
All she thinks about is
what could make you happy.

14:12.184 --> 14:16.522
And I love her for caring
about her younger brother that way.

14:16.522 --> 14:19.859
How could I trust anyone
other than Sarasa?

14:19.859 --> 14:24.029
You're right. It's true that
trusting others can be difficult.

14:24.029 --> 14:29.865
But if you continue to reject others,
I'm sure Sarasa's worries will never end.

14:31.871 --> 14:36.208
But actually I'm relieved now.
You're all right.

14:36.208 --> 14:38.544
You saved Zero just like this.

14:38.544 --> 14:41.547
Being able to protect someone
is the symbol of strength.

14:41.547 --> 14:43.048
Thank you, Ichii-kun.

14:43.048 --> 14:48.220
I'll bring you some tea right now,
so please make yourself at home.

14:48.220 --> 14:51.056
No... I didn't protect him.

14:51.056 --> 14:52.892
In fact, because of me he was...

14:52.892 --> 14:54.627
Ichii...

14:54.627 --> 14:55.895
You're awake.

14:55.895 --> 14:56.896
I...

14:56.896 --> 14:58.297
They said it's just a simple cold.

14:58.297 --> 14:59.899
Okay... I'm sorry.

14:59.899 --> 15:00.900
Why?

15:00.900 --> 15:04.737
Because you came out for me,
but look what happened...

15:04.737 --> 15:06.906
So I'm sorry, but I'll get better soon,

15:06.906 --> 15:10.242
And when I'm better
let's study magic together, all right?

15:10.242 --> 15:11.911
I can't wait!

15:11.911 --> 15:13.579
Give me a break!

15:13.579 --> 15:15.915
I had no intention of going to see you,

15:15.915 --> 15:18.918
and I wasn't going to pay back the
money that I borrowed from you either!

15:18.918 --> 15:22.254
I just wanted to use you!

15:22.254 --> 15:22.922
What?

15:22.922 --> 15:24.757
Because you're a rich kid!

15:24.757 --> 15:26.926
Because you're a clueless rich kid,

15:26.926 --> 15:29.762
so I thought it'd be easy
to fool you, that's all!

15:29.762 --> 15:33.265
And don't you ever come near me
if you understand! You hear me?

15:33.265 --> 15:35.267
Ichii!

15:35.267 --> 15:36.936
I...

15:36.936 --> 15:38.927
I hate you so much!

15:40.606 --> 15:42.267
Ichii...

15:45.611 --> 15:49.615
Why would he look at me with those eyes?

15:49.615 --> 15:52.277
How could he smile that way?

15:54.620 --> 15:56.121
Shit!

15:56.121 --> 15:59.792
Is he an idiot or what?

15:59.792 --> 16:02.661
Why would he look at me
straight in the eyes like that?

16:02.661 --> 16:05.630
At someone who's bad
and a piece of shit like me...

16:07.466 --> 16:11.470
Is he an idiot or...

16:11.470 --> 16:14.803
I'm the one who's an idiot?

16:23.315 --> 16:26.652
Hey, Ichii, I'm not going to marry.

16:26.652 --> 16:27.653
What?

16:27.653 --> 16:32.658
How could I be happy with
myself when you're sad?

16:32.658 --> 16:35.327
We're the only siblings
we have, you know.

16:35.327 --> 16:36.829
Have you talked to Jeff about it?

16:36.829 --> 16:38.990
No, but I will.

16:40.499 --> 16:42.334
Come on, let's go!

16:42.334 --> 16:45.504
Hey, bro, check this out.
That's the guy from...

16:45.504 --> 16:46.338
Look!

16:46.338 --> 16:50.707
He's got a girl with him today.
What a cheeky little bastard!

16:52.678 --> 16:54.009
I see...

16:56.015 --> 16:59.018
Huh? Sarasa, do you have the key?

16:59.018 --> 17:01.887
I think I left my key in the room.

17:01.887 --> 17:04.014
Hey, Sarasa, do you have the key...

17:07.693 --> 17:08.861
Sarasa!

17:08.861 --> 17:11.864
You bastards! What are
you doing to Sarasa?

17:11.864 --> 17:14.196
Thank you for the other day, young man!

17:17.036 --> 17:20.372
Got ya! That's the shackle
that seals magic.

17:20.372 --> 17:23.375
If you try to cast a spell,
you'll be in agony!

17:23.375 --> 17:25.044
You son of a bitch!

17:25.044 --> 17:26.045
Ichii!

17:26.045 --> 17:28.047
Come on! Don't try to
make a scene, young lady.

17:28.047 --> 17:32.051
This special show is going to be ruined
if people start gathering here, you know.

17:32.051 --> 17:33.052
No!

17:33.052 --> 17:34.053
No!!

17:34.053 --> 17:36.722
Don't you touch Sarasa!
What are you going to do to her?

17:36.722 --> 17:38.223
Stop it! Stop it!

17:38.223 --> 17:39.747
Stop it!!

17:44.063 --> 17:45.064
Zero?

17:45.064 --> 17:46.065
Zero! You...

17:46.065 --> 17:50.069
I'll take care of things here.
Sarasa, hurry up and go get Jeff!

17:50.069 --> 17:50.903
But...

17:50.903 --> 17:52.234
Hurry! Hurry!

17:53.072 --> 17:55.404
- I'm not going to-
- Let you do that!!

17:57.076 --> 18:00.746
Don't move! I may be a kid,
but I can still use magic!

18:00.746 --> 18:02.407
Destruction magic!

18:03.082 --> 18:04.413
Carly!

18:05.417 --> 18:07.753
He's pretty good for a kid.

18:07.753 --> 18:09.084
But!

18:12.091 --> 18:14.082
He's too naive!

18:17.596 --> 18:21.100
Zero! You can't handle this!
You're no match for that guy!

18:21.100 --> 18:22.768
You need to get out of here now!

18:22.768 --> 18:27.773
No way. How could I run away,
leaving you behind, Ichii?

18:27.773 --> 18:28.607
Zero...

18:28.607 --> 18:31.777
I want to become a sorcerer no matter what!

18:31.777 --> 18:36.612
That's why I need a strong partner!
That's why I really need you, Ichii!

18:38.450 --> 18:41.283
Stop it! He's not someone
you can go up against!

18:42.788 --> 18:44.123
It's no use!

18:44.123 --> 18:47.459
You couldn't defeat
me in your wildest dreams!

18:47.459 --> 18:51.623
After all that's nothing
but amateur-level magic!

18:53.966 --> 18:55.801
Zero! Zero!

18:55.801 --> 18:58.804
You need to run now! Get out of there!

18:58.804 --> 19:01.473
No! I'm your partner, Ichii!

19:01.473 --> 19:04.465
I'm going to become a pro
with you, Ichii, so-

19:05.811 --> 19:07.813
Zero! Zero!!

19:07.813 --> 19:11.150
I want the power...
I want the greater power!

19:11.150 --> 19:14.813
The power that's powerful enough
to protect my own partner at least!

19:16.155 --> 19:18.323
We're partners!

19:18.323 --> 19:21.827
Being able to protect someone
is the symbol of strength.

19:21.827 --> 19:24.463
What's your dream, Ichii?

19:24.463 --> 19:26.165
My...

19:26.165 --> 19:28.656
What's your dream?

19:31.170 --> 19:32.838
Dream...

19:32.838 --> 19:36.842
My dream is to protect the people
who're dear to me...

19:36.842 --> 19:38.844
to protect the strength to chase my dream!

19:38.844 --> 19:40.179
That's it!

19:40.179 --> 19:44.513
I want to protect it!
As long as I live! With all my might!

19:48.854 --> 19:50.189
- No...
- No way!

19:50.189 --> 19:52.191
I want to be strong!

19:52.191 --> 19:54.526
I want the power!

19:54.526 --> 19:56.862
In order to protect the people
who're dear to me!

19:56.862 --> 19:59.031
In order to protect their dreams!

19:59.031 --> 20:01.200
- You-
- You two are-

20:01.200 --> 20:02.861
- Because we're partners!
- Because we're partners!

20:15.881 --> 20:17.549
Destruction magic!

20:17.549 --> 20:19.210
Defense magic!

20:24.556 --> 20:25.224
What's that?

20:25.224 --> 20:27.559
You smart asses!

20:27.559 --> 20:30.892
I'm going to destroy you
along with your stupid dreams!

20:35.567 --> 20:36.235
They'll be fine!

20:36.235 --> 20:37.236
What?

20:37.236 --> 20:41.240
Probably Zero and Ichii
will overcome the adults.

20:41.240 --> 20:44.573
And their strength will overcome
the pros' before you know it!

20:47.079 --> 20:49.748
What!? He sucked it in?

20:49.748 --> 20:52.740
And I'm going to
return it all back to you!

20:58.257 --> 21:00.157
It-It's going to suck me in!

21:10.936 --> 21:14.428
All right! Don't you
ever come back, you jerk!

21:16.275 --> 21:17.276
Jeff?

21:17.276 --> 21:20.612
I enjoyed watching it... Your magic...

21:20.612 --> 21:23.282
What an outstanding combination that was!

21:23.282 --> 21:24.283
Ichii!

21:24.283 --> 21:26.285
Ichii!

21:26.285 --> 21:28.954
Are you hurt? Are you okay, Ichii?

21:28.954 --> 21:33.458
Sarasa, after all this,
you'd still come to me?

21:33.458 --> 21:36.295
You know, you don't need
to feel obligated to do this.

21:36.295 --> 21:40.299
Just go. Go to the person,
who's most important to you, Sarasa...

21:40.299 --> 21:43.969
To the person, whom you love
the most in this whole wide world...

21:43.969 --> 21:47.306
Jeff! If you let anything happen
to Sarasa, I'll kick your butt!

21:47.306 --> 21:53.312
I know! I'll protect her
with everything I've got... For you...

21:53.312 --> 21:55.647
Big Sis!

21:55.647 --> 21:57.316
Because we're the only siblings we have,

21:57.316 --> 22:00.319
and only two of us alone
have made it this far together,

22:00.319 --> 22:03.322
your happiness is my happiness...

22:03.322 --> 22:06.992
If he's someone you like, I've decided
I'm going to like him as well!

22:06.992 --> 22:11.663
Congratulations on your marriage,
Big Sis. I want you to be happy.

22:11.663 --> 22:13.999
Ichii... Ichii!

22:13.999 --> 22:18.003
Big Sis, you've got the wrong person!
Come on, wipe your tears.

22:18.003 --> 22:22.341
And you need to look at him
with your best smile.

22:22.341 --> 22:23.942
Ichii...

22:23.942 --> 22:26.411
Now go. Go to him.

22:26.411 --> 22:32.441
He's going to bring you happiness,
so be happy, Big Sis!

22:34.052 --> 22:35.354
Ichii!

22:35.354 --> 22:39.358
Don't worry! Time will
help you forget everything.

22:39.358 --> 22:42.194
And your dreams will support everything.

22:42.194 --> 22:45.364
Big Sis, right now I'm no longer alone.
I have my partner

22:45.364 --> 22:48.367
with whom I will pursue my dreams
together right here!

22:48.367 --> 22:50.369
So, Ichii, you mean...

22:50.369 --> 22:53.372
Yeah! I will pursue my dreams with you!

22:53.372 --> 22:56.375
I will pursue a dream called
"the sorcery test" with you!

22:56.375 --> 22:59.378
But you know, if we're going to
take the test we will pass the test!

22:59.378 --> 23:02.905
Yeah! I'm all up for it, Ichii!

23:07.052 --> 23:09.054
I didn't know that's what happened...

23:09.054 --> 23:12.057
That's why... That's why...

23:12.057 --> 23:13.058
- These two understand
each other so much...

23:13.058 --> 23:16.895
- Let me see it zura!
- These two understand
each other so much...

23:16.895 --> 23:19.898
That's why they trust each other so much!

23:19.898 --> 23:21.733
Nina, do you want to
take a picture with us?

23:21.733 --> 23:23.802
I want to send it to Sarasa via e-mail.

23:23.802 --> 23:24.736
Sure!

23:24.736 --> 23:29.408
That must be why they take
such good care of each other!

23:29.408 --> 23:31.535
- Say "cheese"!
- Say "cheese" zura!

23:33.912 --> 23:37.404
Just like I thought,
these two are the best!!

23:39.084 --> 23:40.415
Sarasa...

23:44.423 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.254
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:02.040 --> 24:07.846
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.846 --> 24:13.652
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.652 --> 24:19.524
No matter which direction
I look, his eyes are crystals.

24:19.524 --> 24:25.430
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.430 --> 24:31.269
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.269 --> 24:39.744
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.744 --> 24:45.417
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.417 --> 24:51.723
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.723 --> 24:57.629
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.629 --> 25:03.468
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.468 --> 25:09.065
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:11.343 --> 25:13.512
Christmas is right around the corner!

25:13.512 --> 25:15.180
Who are you going to
spend Christmas with, Nina?

25:15.180 --> 25:17.516
Huh? I haven't really
decided on that yet.

25:17.516 --> 25:19.184
- That's not going to work!
- That's not going to work!

25:19.184 --> 25:21.520
Christmas is the day that
you spend with the person

25:21.520 --> 25:22.687
who's most important to you!

25:22.687 --> 25:25.857
It's a very important day
that comes only once a year!

25:25.857 --> 25:27.526
Zero-kun or Ichii-kun?

25:27.526 --> 25:28.860
- You need to pick one!
- You need to pick one!

25:28.860 --> 25:30.195
What?

25:30.195 --> 25:34.199
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop,
"The Last Present?"

25:34.199 --> 25:38.659
As long as I can have fun with everyone,
I wouldn't want anything else...
